{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":28.239999771118164,"text":"A floor made of thousands of small stones, cut into cubes, and set one at a time. It lay in a Roman house in Thessaloniki, and was lifted whole to come into the museum. Go close, and you will see the stones are not all the same size. Where detail was needed, in an eye or a finger, the craftsmen used much smaller pieces. It is the same idea as pixels on a screen 2,500 years earlier.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.800000011920929},{"word":"floor","start":0.800000011920929,"end":0.8399999737739563},{"word":"made","start":0.8399999737739563,"end":1.1399999856948853},{"word":"of","start":1.1399999856948853,"end":1.8200000524520874},{"word":"thousands","start":1.8200000524520874,"end":1.8200000524520874},{"word":"of","start":1.8200000524520874,"end":2.180000066757202},{"word":"small","start":2.180000066757202,"end":2.619999885559082},{"word":"stones","start":2.619999885559082,"end":3.059999942779541},{"word":"cut","start":3.5799999237060547,"end":3.6600000858306885},{"word":"into","start":3.6600000858306885,"end":3.940000057220459},{"word":"cubes","start":3.940000057220459,"end":4.340000152587891},{"word":"and","start":4.519999980926514,"end":4.920000076293945},{"word":"set","start":4.920000076293945,"end":4.940000057220459},{"word":"one","start":4.940000057220459,"end":5.260000228881836},{"word":"at","start":5.260000228881836,"end":5.420000076293945},{"word":"a","start":5.420000076293945,"end":5.71999979019165},{"word":"time","start":5.71999979019165,"end":5.78000020980835},{"word":"It","start":6.619999885559082,"end":6.820000171661377},{"word":"lay","start":6.820000171661377,"end":7},{"word":"in","start":7,"end":7.28000020980835},{"word":"a","start":7.28000020980835,"end":7.71999979019165},{"word":"Roman","start":7.71999979019165,"end":7.71999979019165},{"word":"house","start":7.71999979019165,"end":8.119999885559082},{"word":"in","start":8.119999885559082,"end":8.5},{"word":"Thessa